===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q234915}}{{lb|en|Islam}} The [[pilgrimage]] to [[Mecca]] made by pious [[Muslim]]s; one of the [[five pillars]] of Islam.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1855|author=Richard Francis Burton|title=Personal Narrative of a Pilgrimage to Al-Madinah & Meccah|section=Appendix I
|passage=The word '''Hajj''' is explained by Moslem divines to mean “Kasd,” or aspiration, and to express man’s sentiment that he is but a wayfarer on earth wending towards another and a nobler world.}}
